<title>PORTUGAL: Techical problems halt share, bond trade in Lisbon.</title>
<headline>Techical problems halt share, bond trade in Lisbon.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cash share and bond trade was halted on the Lisbon bourse by technical problems, a bourse spokesman said.  </p>
<p>The spokesman said that the problem appeared to lie in the communications system but investigations were still being carried out.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3113126</p>
